// "[Permanent] endures N" [CR#701.63a]: its controller creates an N/N white
// Spirit creature token unless they put N +1/+1 counters on that permanent. The
// "unless" is the controller's own choice between the two.
KeywordAction(
    name: "endure",
    params: [Subject, Amount],
    spelling: "endure",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "endure",
        frame_set: MeasureComplement,
    ),
    // The deed's performer is not a player (Lean `actFacts`), so the wrapper
    // records none.
    agent: None,
    body: chooseOne(
        putCounters(Param(1), p1p1Counter, Param(0)),
        act(controllerOf(Param(0)), createToken(creatureTokenOf(Param(1), Param(1), [White], [spirit]))),
    ),
)
